{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01A6Ba3aEEsczcZmaDaPy7WP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted data for each planned experiment in the experiment_plan that has status \"QUEUED\" or \"RUNNING\" (i.e., pending experiments), based on the \"median\" tier definition they provided.\n\nLet me identify the pending experiments from the registry:\n\n1. `exception_only_nomarker_seed42` - QUEUED\n2. `loop_only_seed123` - RUNNING\n3. `loop_only_seed456` - QUEUED\n4. `exception_only_nomarker_seed123` - QUEUED\n\n\n5. `exception_only_nomarker_seed456` - QUEUED\n6. `qwen15b_vota_seed42` - RUNNING\n7. `qwen15b_full_trace_seed42` - QUEUED\n8. `codellama13b_exception_only_seed42` - QUEUED\n9. `codellama13b_no_trace_seed42` - QUEUED\n10. `codellama13b_vota_seed42` - QUEUED\n\nI need to filter out the ones marked as killed since those are abandoned, and focus only on the truly pending experiments.\n\nLooking at the registry, I can see there are two experiments currently running and the rest are queued. The core hypothesis I'm testing involves comparing Qwen-1.5B's performance with the VOTA approach against other configurations.\n\nThe key findings emerging are that the 1.5B model shows surprisingly high VOTA performance, the nomarker ablation suggests the marker itself isn't the critical ingredient for these models, and the loop-only experiments show concerning variance across different seeds that questions the stability of tier 2 results. This points to only 2-3 models being truly effective, with the 1.5B advantage stemming more from simplicity than raw accuracy gains, while DeepSeek's sensitivity to seed variation remains a concern. reviewers 视为 acknowledged limitation 而非 contribution\n\nKey metric ranges:\n- qwen15b_vota_accuracy: [95.0, 99.0]\n- nomarker_accuracy_drop_vs_marker: [0.0, 1.5]\n- loop_only_3seed_std_pp: [2.0, 5.0]\n- effective_model_count: [2, 3]\n- models_where_exception_gt_vota: [2, 3]\n- deepseek_exception_only_median: [99.33, 99.33]\n- qwen7b_exception_only: [99.83, 99.83]\n\nNarrative direction: Claim 1 shifts from \"exception dominates\" to \"exception is sufficient and simplest — matching or exceeding VOTA with ~16x fewer tokens and no execution reasoning requirement.\"\n\nAlready have qwen15b_exception_only_seed42 at 99.83% and qwen15b_no_trace_seed42 at 67.31%. For Qwen 7B, the baseline loop_only result is 85.63%, which gives me a reference point. Looking at the expected ranges, exception_only without the marker should land around 99.0-99.5% based on the minimal accuracy drop pattern, while the loop_only variants across different seeds should cluster around that 85.63% baseline with roughly ±3-5pp variance. Still need to confirm the qwen15b_vota_seed42 result. Looking at the experiment_plan section, all the listed experiments from plan_001 through plan_mvp_fulltrace are already completed. The pending experiments the user is asking about must be the ones currently in QUEUED or RUNNING status in the registry, so I need to predict performance metrics for those and format them into YAML output. results for all QUEUED/RUNNING experiments. Let me list them:\n\n1. exception_only_nomarker_seed42 - QUEUED\n2. loop_only_seed123 - RUNNING\n3. loop_only_seed456 - QUEUED\n4. exception_only_nomarker_seed123 - QUEUED\n5. exception_only_nomarker_seed456 - QUEUED\n6. qwen15b_vota_seed42 - RUNNING\n7. qwen15b_full_trace_seed42 - QUEUED\n8. codellama13b_exception_only_seed42 - QUEUED\n9. codellama13b_no_trace_seed42 - QUEUED\n10. codellama13b_vota_seed42 - QUEUED\n\nNow I'm predicting each one based on the median tier. For exception_only_nomarker_seed42, removing the [ERROR] marker while keeping exception content should drop performance by 0-1.5pp since the model learns from the semantic content rather than just the tag format. Across the three nomarker seeds, I'm seeing a mean around 99.33% with minimal variance, confirming the marker itself isn't the critical factor. Moving to loop_only_seed123, I need to examine how the original seed42 performed to establish the baseline. Looking at how the 1.5B model degrades with full traces—dropping nearly 8 percentage points compared to the 7B—I'm predicting around 74.5% for that configuration. Now I'm moving to CodeLlama-13B, which is a larger model with different architecture; the exception-only setup should perform very well at ~99.5%, while the no-trace baseline sits around 76%, and I'm still working through the VOTA prediction for this model.\n\nActually, I need to reconsider whether these CodeLlama experiments are even going to complete—the median tier shows the effective model count is somewhere between 2 and 3, which suggests some ambiguity in the results. But since they're still queued rather than killed, I should go ahead and predict them. Looking at the status more carefully, the CodeLlama-13B runs haven't been terminated like some of the other experiments, so they're still valid to forecast.\n\nThe 1.5B model is providing supplementary evidence beyond the core Qwen 7B and DeepSeek results, though it's weaker than expected—the fact that it already hit 99.83% accuracy with exception-only suggests the advantage there is more about simplicity than raw accuracy gains.\n\nNow I need to structure the response with rationales for each prediction.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":33168,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":33168},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"94c45f9c-07e7-4d3f-a4f8-3f90e0df099a","uuid":"1334b41c-4dea-4c63-a99c-2f40098f7239"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01A6Ba3aEEsczcZmaDaPy7WP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: \"Claim 1 从 'exception dominates' 调整为 'exception is sufficient and simplest — matching or exceeding VOTA with ~16x fewer tokens and no execution reasoning requirement.' nomarker 结果正面转化: exception content itself carries fault signal, structural formatting optional. Claim 3 Tier 2 加 seed-dependent stability caveat. 1.5B 数据作 supplementary evidence。\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"exception_only_nomarker_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"nomarker_ablation\"\n    description: \"Qwen-7B exception_only 去除 [ERROR] format marker，保留 exception type+message 内容\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9933\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9882\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.9975\n      n: 1190\n      pass_precision: 1.0\n      pass_recall: 0.9906\n      pass_f1: 0.9953\n      fail_precision: 0.9769\n      fail_recall: 1.0\n      fail_f1: 0.9883\n      errors: 8\n      drop_vs_marker: 0.005\n      train_loss: 0.115\n    result_rationale: \"在 median 档下，[ERROR] marker 不是 active ingredient。SFT 模型通过 exception content 的语义（type name + message 描述 fault 本质）学到 pass/fail mapping，而非依赖 [ERROR] 关键字的 regex-like 检测。证据：regex baseline B1 ([ERROR] presence) 仅 93.45%，远低于 SFT 的 99.83%——说明 SFT 学习的是 content 而非 marker。去除 marker 后 drop 仅 0.5pp（99.83→99.33%），8 errors 与 DeepSeek seed42/456 完全一致（均 8/1190），暗示这些额外 errors 来自 borderline samples 在没有格式化对齐辅助时的轻微混淆，但不改变核心能力。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"nomarker_vs_marker_comparison\"\n        columns: [\"condition\", \"accuracy\", \"errors\", \"drop_pp\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"exception_only (with marker)\", \"99.83%\", 2, \"—\"]\n          - [\"exception_only_nomarker\", \"99.33%\", 8, \"-0.50\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: marker vs nomarker accuracy with 95% CI error bars, showing overlapping CIs\"\n    analysis: \"Drop 0.50pp 在统计上可能 borderline significant (McNemar p≈0.03-0.08)，但 practical significance 极小。支持论文叙事：'exception content itself carries the fault signal; structural formatting is optional, providing at most marginal alignment benefit.' 这比 'marker is required' 更 fundamental 的 claim。\"\n\n  - name: \"exception_only_nomarker_seed123\"\n    plan_id: \"nomarker_ablation\"\n    description: \"Qwen-7B nomarker seed123 复现\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9916\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9857\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.9966\n      n: 1190\n      errors: 10\n      drop_vs_marker_seed123: 0.0067\n      train_loss: 0.118\n    result_rationale: \"Seed123 在有 marker 时 99.83%（2 errors，irreducible GeneratorExit）。去除 marker 后，模型在没有 [ERROR] 格式对齐的情况下对 ~8 个额外 borderline samples（exception content 较模糊的 shorter/generic error messages）产生误判。总 10 errors 中 2 个是 irreducible (GeneratorExit)，8 个是 marker-removal 引入的 edge cases。Seed 间方差极小（±0.17pp），确认 nomarker 条件下 Qwen 7B 仍然 seed-robust。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"与 seed42 结果一致方向（drop ~0.5-0.7pp），3-seed 方差 <0.2pp 确认 nomarker 稳定性。\"\n\n  - name: \"exception_only_nomarker_seed456\"\n    plan_id: \"nomarker_ablation\"\n    description: \"Qwen-7B nomarker seed456 复现\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9950\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9899\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.9992\n      n: 1190\n      errors: 6\n      drop_vs_marker_seed456: 0.0033\n      train_loss: 0.112\n    result_rationale: \"Seed456 LoRA 初始化落入稍好的 basin，即使去除 marker 仍只有 6 errors（2 irreducible + 4 borderline）。不同 seed 对 marker removal 的敏感度有轻微差异（4-10 extra errors range），但总体 pattern 一致：nomarker 条件在 99.0-99.5% 区间稳定。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"nomarker_3seed_summary\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"accuracy\", \"errors\", \"drop_vs_marker\"]\n        rows:\n          - [42, \"99.33%\", 8, \"-0.50pp\"]\n          - [123, \"99.16%\", 10, \"-0.67pp\"]\n          - [456, \"99.50%\", 6, \"-0.33pp\"]\n          - [\"mean±std\", \"99.33%±0.17\", \"8.0±2.0\", \"-0.50±0.17pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired bar chart: 3 seeds × 2 conditions (marker/nomarker), with paired lines showing per-seed drop\"\n    analysis: \"3-seed nomarker mean=99.33%（与 marker 99.83% 差 0.50pp），std=0.17pp（marker 条件 std=0.00）。Marker removal 引入极小方差但不改变核心结论。McNemar 3-seed pooled: nomarker 仍显著优于 VOTA (99.33% vs 99.41%, 但 CI 重叠)。正面叙事：'exception content 是 sufficient signal，formatting 是 optional convenience'。\"\n\n  - name: \"loop_only_seed123\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: \"Qwen-7B loop_only component seed123 复现\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.8118\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.7882\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.8345\n      n: 1190\n      pass_precision: 0.896\n      pass_recall: 0.838\n      pass_f1: 0.866\n      fail_precision: 0.649\n      fail_recall: 0.748\n      fail_f1: 0.695\n      train_loss: 0.078\n      drop_vs_seed42: -0.0445\n    result_rationale: \"Loop compression 是 Tier 2 behavioral signal，需要模型理解循环执行模式（iteration counts, early termination）。与 Tier 1 exception signal（binary fault presence）不同，loop pattern 的学习对 LoRA 初始化更敏感。Seed123 落入较差的 basin，对 loop→verdict mapping 的 fail 类学习不充分（fail_recall 从 seed42 的 82% 降至 ~75%）。4.5pp drop 对应 ~53 个额外 errors，主要集中在 loop 正常但代码实际有 non-loop-related bugs 的 samples（loop 信号无法区分）。这证实 Tier 2 信号的 model-dependent + seed-dependent 特性。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Seed123 的 81.2% 仍显著高于 no_trace (75.13%, p<0.01)，但相对 seed42 (85.63%) drop 4.5pp 说明 loop signal 的 learnability 方差较大。对比 exception_only seed123 仍是 99.83%——Tier 1 vs Tier 2 的 seed robustness 差异鲜明。\"\n\n  - name: \"loop_only_seed456\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: \"Qwen-7B loop_only component seed456 复现\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.8807\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.8613\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.8992\n      n: 1190\n      pass_precision: 0.936\n      pass_recall: 0.892\n      pass_f1: 0.913\n      fail_precision: 0.766\n      fail_recall: 0.851\n      fail_f1: 0.806\n      train_loss: 0.069\n      lift_vs_seed42: 0.0244\n    result_rationale: \"Seed456 LoRA 初始化落入较好的 basin，loop→verdict mapping 学习更充分。Fail_recall 从 seed42 的 82% 提升至 85%，加上 pass 类也有改善（+2pp recall）。总体 88.1% 是 loop_only 条件的 upper range，但仍远低于 exception_only (99.83%)，确认 Tier 2 信号即使在最好 seed 下也无法匹配 Tier 1。差异主要来源：loop compression 仅编码 behavioral pattern（iteration count, convergence），无法捕获 non-iterative failures (assertion errors, type errors, edge case bugs)。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"loop_only_3seed_summary\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"accuracy\", \"fail_recall\", \"interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [42, \"85.63%\", 0.820, \"baseline\"]\n          - [123, \"81.18%\", 0.748, \"LoRA 较差 basin\"]\n          - [456, \"88.07%\", 0.851, \"LoRA 较好 basin\"]\n          - [\"mean±std\", \"84.96%±3.47\", \"0.806±0.053\", \"Tier 2 seed-sensitive\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Violin plot: loop_only 3-seed distribution vs exception_only 3-seed distribution (后者为单点 99.83%)\"\n      - \"Error analysis: Venn diagram of errors across 3 seeds — showing low overlap (seed-specific failures)\"\n    analysis: \"3-seed std=3.47pp（vs exception_only std=0.00pp）。这是 Claim 3 'Tier 2 seed-dependent stability' caveat 的核心证据。Range 81-88% 意味着 loop_only 的 usefulness 取决于 training luck，而 exception_only 完全不依赖。论文措辞从 'robust behavioral signal' 弱化为 'useful but variable behavioral signal, fully subsumed by Tier 1 exception events.' 同时 loop_only mean (84.96%) ≈ full_trace_label_only (86.22%)，确认 VOTA loop compression 精确提取 full trace 中的 useful behavioral subset。\"\n\n  - name: \"qwen15b_vota_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_1.5b_scaling\"\n    description: \"Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B VOTA SFT\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9697\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9596\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.9790\n      n: 1190\n      pass_precision: 0.978\n      pass_recall: 0.982\n      pass_f1: 0.980\n      fail_precision: 0.945\n      fail_recall: 0.937\n      fail_f1: 0.941\n      train_loss: 0.065\n      eval_loss: 0.12\n      lift_vs_no_trace: 0.2966\n      gap_vs_exception_only: -0.0286\n    result_rationale: \"1.5B 模型在 VOTA 条件下达 97.0%——远高于预期的 'small model struggles with trace reasoning' 叙事。原因：(1) VOTA trace 在此数据集上已经高度结构化（exception + ae + loop 三组件），1.5B 有足够容量记忆这些 pattern；(2) 训练 3 epochs 在仅 4720 samples 上允许充分拟合；(3) max_length=2048 对 1.5B VOTA 同样适用且 Qwen tokenizer 的 VOTA 样本大多在 2048 以内（Qwen 7B 无截断问题）。关键：exception_only 已达 99.83%（与 7B 完全一致），VOTA gap 仅 2.86pp（vs 7B 的 0.42pp）——gap 存在但缩窄的方向反了。实际上是 VOTA 在 1.5B 上降了（99.41→97.0%）而 exception 不降（99.83→99.83%），说明 VOTA 的 Tier 2 组件（loop compression）需要更多 model capacity，而 exception signal 的 simplicity 让 1.5B 也能完美学习。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"qwen15b_condition_comparison\"\n        columns: [\"condition\", \"1.5B accuracy\", \"7B accuracy\", \"cross-scale gap\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"no_trace\", \"67.31%\", \"75.13%\", \"-7.82pp\"]\n          - [\"VOTA\", \"97.0%\", \"99.41%\", \"-2.41pp\"]\n          - [\"exception_only\", \"99.83%\", \"99.83%\", \"0.00pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: 1.5B vs 7B across conditions, highlighting exception_only zero gap\"\n      - \"Line plot: model scale (x) vs accuracy (y) per condition — showing exception_only flat line, VOTA slight decrease, no_trace steeper decrease\"\n    analysis: \"1.5B VOTA 97.0% 削弱了 'exception dominates VOTA' 的 accuracy gap claim（差距仅 2.86pp，虽然 7B 上 exception 与 VOTA McNemar p=0.01，1.5B 上 p 可能更显著因为 gap 更大）。但反过来强化了 efficiency + robustness angle: exception_only 在 1.5B 上与 7B 完全一致（99.83%），不受模型规模影响；VOTA 在 1.5B 上降 2.4pp，说明其 Tier 2 组件的 model-capability dependency。Claim 1 pivot: 'exception is sufficient and simplest — achieving identical performance (99.83%) regardless of model scale, while VOTA performance degrades on smaller models.' 这在 EMNLP 是强 practical argument。\"\n\n  - name: \"qwen15b_full_trace_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_1.5b_scaling\"\n    description: \"Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B full_trace SFT\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.7445\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.7193\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.7689\n      n: 1190\n      pass_precision: 0.842\n      pass_recall: 0.793\n      pass_f1: 0.817\n      fail_precision: 0.548\n      fail_recall: 0.623\n      fail_f1: 0.583\n      train_loss: 0.062\n      eval_loss: 0.095\n      lift_vs_no_trace: 0.0714\n    result_rationale: \"1.5B full_trace 预计 74.5%（vs 7B 的 81.76%，drop 7.3pp）。较小模型在处理长 full trace（高噪声、信息过载）时能力更弱。但不会像 DeepSeek full_trace v1 那样完全坍塌，因为 Qwen tokenizer 对 full trace 的 token 化效率较好，label 不会被截断。74.5% 略高于 no_trace (67.31%)——full trace 仍提供 marginal benefit (+7.1pp)，但远低于 VOTA (97.0%) 和 exception_only (99.83%)。1.5B 上 information overload 问题更严重：模型容量小 → attention 被 noisy tokens 稀释更多 → gradient dilution + information overload 双重效应放大。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"information_density_scaling\"\n        columns: [\"condition\", \"1.5B\", \"7B\", \"gap\", \"interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"no_trace\", \"67.31%\", \"75.13%\", \"-7.82pp\", \"baseline capability gap\"]\n          - [\"full_trace\", \"74.45%\", \"81.76%\", \"-7.31pp\", \"information overload scales with model size\"]\n          - [\"VOTA\", \"97.0%\", \"99.41%\", \"-2.41pp\", \"compressed trace partially compensates\"]\n          - [\"exception_only\", \"99.83%\", \"99.83%\", \"0.00pp\", \"minimal signal immune to scale\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: condition × model_size → accuracy, with color gradient showing scale sensitivity\"\n    analysis: \"Full_trace 在 1.5B 上仅 marginal improvement over no_trace (+7.1pp vs 7B 的 +6.6pp)，information overload 在小模型上没有更严重（gap 保持 ~7pp），但 base capability 更低。关键对比：full_trace→exception_only lift 在 1.5B 上为 25.4pp（vs 7B 18.1pp），说明小模型从 signal extraction 中获益更多——进一步支持 'information density is the bottleneck, smaller models suffer more from it' 论点。这强化 Claim 2。\"\n\n  - name: \"codellama13b_exception_only_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_3rd_model\"\n    description: \"CodeLlama-13B-Instruct exception_only SFT\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9950\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9907\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.9983\n      n: 1190\n      pass_precision: 1.0\n      pass_recall: 0.993\n      pass_f1: 0.996\n      fail_precision: 0.985\n      fail_recall: 1.0\n      fail_f1: 0.992\n      train_loss: 0.098\n      errors: 6\n    result_rationale: \"CodeLlama-13B 是 13B 参数模型（比 Qwen 7B/DeepSeek 6.7B 大约 2x），exception signal 的 structural simplicity 使其在更大模型上同样容易学习。预计 99.50%——略低于 Qwen 7B (99.83%) 的 2 errors irreducible ceiling，因为 CodeLlama 的 chat template 和 tokenizer 与 Qwen 不同，可能引入 2-4 个额外 borderline errors。但仍然是 near-perfect，远高于 VOTA 条件。6 errors 中 2 个是 GeneratorExit irreducible，4 个是 tokenizer/template 差异导致的 edge cases。这作为第 3 个模型验证 exception signal 的 cross-architecture robustness。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"第 3 模型达 99.50% 将 effective_model_count 从 2 提升至 3（Qwen 99.83%, CodeLlama 99.50%, DeepSeek 99.33% median）。exception_only 在 3 个架构不同的模型上均 >99%（最差情况排除 DeepSeek seed123 outlier），构成 strong cross-model evidence。\"\n\n  - name: \"codellama13b_no_trace_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_3rd_model\"\n    description: \"CodeLlama-13B-Instruct no_trace baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.7622\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.7378\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.7857\n      n: 1190\n      pass_precision: 0.864\n      pass_recall: 0.790\n      pass_f1: 0.826\n      fail_precision: 0.578\n      fail_recall: 0.694\n      fail_f1: 0.631\n      train_loss: 0.165\n    result_rationale: \"CodeLlama-13B 的 no_trace baseline 预计 76.2%——介于 Qwen 7B (75.13%) 和 DeepSeek (73.36%) 之间偏高。13B 参数量提供略多的 pre-trained knowledge (code pattern recognition from source code alone)，但没有 trace 信息时 ceiling 仍被 'guessing from code structure' 限制。CodeLlama 虽然更大，但在 HumanEval/MBPP 这类 competitive programming 题目上其 base code understanding 不必然比 Qwen-7B-Coder (specialized for code) 强很多。Cross-model no_trace gap 维持在 ~2-3pp 范围内（73-76%），确认 baseline capability 跨模型一致。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"no_trace 76.2% 作为 CodeLlama 的 baseline，exception_only lift = 23.3pp（vs Qwen 24.7pp, DeepSeek 26.0pp）。跨模型 trace lift 一致性（23-26pp range）是 trace value 论证的重要支撑。\"\n\n  - name: \"codellama13b_vota_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_3rd_model\"\n    description: \"CodeLlama-13B-Instruct VOTA SFT\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9244\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9092\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.9387\n      n: 1190\n      pass_precision: 0.924\n      pass_recall: 0.980\n      pass_f1: 0.951\n      fail_precision: 0.925\n      fail_recall: 0.785\n      fail_f1: 0.849\n      train_loss: 0.058\n      eval_loss: 0.098\n      gap_vs_exception_only: -0.0706\n    result_rationale: \"CodeLlama-13B VOTA 预计 92.4%——介于 Qwen (99.41%) 和 DeepSeek (84.45%) 之间。CodeLlama 的 execution reasoning capability (CRUXEval-I ~45-48%, 介于 Qwen 56.5% 和 DeepSeek 39% 之间) 决定了其 VOTA utilization 能力。此外需检查 CodeLlama tokenizer 对 VOTA trace 的 token 化效率——如果存在部分截断（类似 DeepSeek），会进一步拉低。VOTA 在 CodeLlama 上 gap vs exception_only 为 7.1pp，远大于 Qwen (0.42pp) 但小于 DeepSeek (14.9pp worst-case)。这符合 'VOTA effectiveness is model-capability-dependent, exception signal bypasses this dependency' 叙事。Fail_recall 78.5% 反映对 loop compression 信息的利用不完全。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"3model_vota_vs_exception_comparison\"\n        columns: [\"model\", \"exception_only\", \"VOTA\", \"gap\", \"CRUXEval-I (est.)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B\", \"99.83%\", \"99.41%\", \"0.42pp\", \"56.5%\"]\n          - [\"CodeLlama-13B\", \"99.50%\", \"92.44%\", \"7.06pp\", \"~46%\"]\n          - [\"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B\", \"99.33%*\", \"84.45%\", \"14.88pp\", \"39.0%\"]\n      - name: \"cross_model_summary_all\"\n        columns: [\"condition\", \"Qwen-7B\", \"Qwen-1.5B\", \"CodeLlama-13B\", \"DeepSeek-6.7B\", \"cross-model std\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"exception_only\", \"99.83%\", \"99.83%\", \"99.50%\", \"99.33%†\", \"0.24pp\"]\n          - [\"VOTA\", \"99.41%\", \"97.0%\", \"92.44%\", \"84.45%\", \"6.56pp\"]\n          - [\"no_trace\", \"75.13%\", \"67.31%\", \"76.22%\", \"73.36%\", \"3.86pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: CRUXEval-I score (x) vs VOTA accuracy (y) with regression line — showing correlation, but exception_only as horizontal line at ~99.5%\"\n      - \"Radar chart: 4 models × 3 conditions, showing exception_only's uniform near-ceiling performance\"\n    analysis: \"CodeLlama VOTA 92.4% 提供了 CRUXEval-VOTA 相关性假说的第 3 个数据点（N=3 仍不足以 claim causation，但 trend 一致：execution reasoning 越强 → VOTA 利用越好）。关键：exception_only cross-model std = 0.24pp vs VOTA cross-model std = 6.56pp (27x ratio)。这是论文最强的定量 evidence for 'exception signal is the most robust component'。Exception 对 model capability 几乎完全 invariant（99.3-99.8%），而 VOTA 高度 model-dependent（84-99%）。Models_where_exception > VOTA = 3/3 (4/4 if count 1.5B)。\"\n\n# Aggregated median-tier narrative impact\naggregate_analysis:\n  claim1_revision: \"Exception events are sufficient and simplest: achieving 99.3-99.8% across 3-4 models regardless of scale (1.5B-13B) or architecture, while VOTA shows 15pp cross-model variance (84-99%). The [ERROR] marker is optional (nomarker drop <1pp); exception content semantics are the active ingredient.\"\n  claim2_reinforcement: \"1.5B data strengthens information density argument: smaller models benefit MORE from signal extraction (full_trace→exception lift = 25.4pp on 1.5B vs 18.1pp on 7B), confirming information overload as scale-dependent bottleneck.\"\n  claim3_caveat: \"Tier 2 (loop_only) 3-seed std=3.47pp confirms seed-dependent stability. Tier 1 (exception_only) 3-seed std=0.00pp. Description revised to 'useful but variable behavioral signal.'\"\n  venue_impact: \"EMNLP main still viable. Sufficiency + efficiency + cross-model robustness angle strengthened by 3rd model + 1.5B evidence. Reviewer concern about 'only dominance on one model' resolved. Primary weakness: exception > VOTA gap on 1.5B is only 2.86pp (borderline practical significance) — pivot to 'same accuracy, 16x fewer tokens, no execution reasoning requirement' as deployment argument.\"\n  key_risk: \"If qwen15b_vota actually reaches 99%+ (upper bound of median range), exception_only advantage disappears on this model pair. Mitigation: frame as 'exception achieves VOTA-level with dramatically less complexity' — a sufficiency claim not requiring strict dominance.\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":33168,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":33168},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"94c45f9c-07e7-4d3f-a4f8-3f90e0df099a","uuid":"6ec6f5ba-a7cc-4648-af0d-18d025d72270"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":208787,"duration_api_ms":210225,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: \"Claim 1 从 'exception dominates' 调整为 'exception is sufficient and simplest — matching or exceeding VOTA with ~16x fewer tokens and no execution reasoning requirement.' nomarker 结果正面转化: exception content itself carries fault signal, structural formatting optional. Claim 3 Tier 2 加 seed-dependent stability caveat. 1.5B 数据作 supplementary evidence。\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"exception_only_nomarker_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"nomarker_ablation\"\n    description: \"Qwen-7B exception_only 去除 [ERROR] format marker，保留 exception type+message 内容\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9933\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9882\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.9975\n      n: 1190\n      pass_precision: 1.0\n      pass_recall: 0.9906\n      pass_f1: 0.9953\n      fail_precision: 0.9769\n      fail_recall: 1.0\n      fail_f1: 0.9883\n      errors: 8\n      drop_vs_marker: 0.005\n      train_loss: 0.115\n    result_rationale: \"在 median 档下，[ERROR] marker 不是 active ingredient。SFT 模型通过 exception content 的语义（type name + message 描述 fault 本质）学到 pass/fail mapping，而非依赖 [ERROR] 关键字的 regex-like 检测。证据：regex baseline B1 ([ERROR] presence) 仅 93.45%，远低于 SFT 的 99.83%——说明 SFT 学习的是 content 而非 marker。去除 marker 后 drop 仅 0.5pp（99.83→99.33%），8 errors 与 DeepSeek seed42/456 完全一致（均 8/1190），暗示这些额外 errors 来自 borderline samples 在没有格式化对齐辅助时的轻微混淆，但不改变核心能力。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"nomarker_vs_marker_comparison\"\n        columns: [\"condition\", \"accuracy\", \"errors\", \"drop_pp\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"exception_only (with marker)\", \"99.83%\", 2, \"—\"]\n          - [\"exception_only_nomarker\", \"99.33%\", 8, \"-0.50\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: marker vs nomarker accuracy with 95% CI error bars, showing overlapping CIs\"\n    analysis: \"Drop 0.50pp 在统计上可能 borderline significant (McNemar p≈0.03-0.08)，但 practical significance 极小。支持论文叙事：'exception content itself carries the fault signal; structural formatting is optional, providing at most marginal alignment benefit.' 这比 'marker is required' 更 fundamental 的 claim。\"\n\n  - name: \"exception_only_nomarker_seed123\"\n    plan_id: \"nomarker_ablation\"\n    description: \"Qwen-7B nomarker seed123 复现\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9916\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9857\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.9966\n      n: 1190\n      errors: 10\n      drop_vs_marker_seed123: 0.0067\n      train_loss: 0.118\n    result_rationale: \"Seed123 在有 marker 时 99.83%（2 errors，irreducible GeneratorExit）。去除 marker 后，模型在没有 [ERROR] 格式对齐的情况下对 ~8 个额外 borderline samples（exception content 较模糊的 shorter/generic error messages）产生误判。总 10 errors 中 2 个是 irreducible (GeneratorExit)，8 个是 marker-removal 引入的 edge cases。Seed 间方差极小（±0.17pp），确认 nomarker 条件下 Qwen 7B 仍然 seed-robust。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"与 seed42 结果一致方向（drop ~0.5-0.7pp），3-seed 方差 <0.2pp 确认 nomarker 稳定性。\"\n\n  - name: \"exception_only_nomarker_seed456\"\n    plan_id: \"nomarker_ablation\"\n    description: \"Qwen-7B nomarker seed456 复现\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9950\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9899\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.9992\n      n: 1190\n      errors: 6\n      drop_vs_marker_seed456: 0.0033\n      train_loss: 0.112\n    result_rationale: \"Seed456 LoRA 初始化落入稍好的 basin，即使去除 marker 仍只有 6 errors（2 irreducible + 4 borderline）。不同 seed 对 marker removal 的敏感度有轻微差异（4-10 extra errors range），但总体 pattern 一致：nomarker 条件在 99.0-99.5% 区间稳定。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"nomarker_3seed_summary\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"accuracy\", \"errors\", \"drop_vs_marker\"]\n        rows:\n          - [42, \"99.33%\", 8, \"-0.50pp\"]\n          - [123, \"99.16%\", 10, \"-0.67pp\"]\n          - [456, \"99.50%\", 6, \"-0.33pp\"]\n          - [\"mean±std\", \"99.33%±0.17\", \"8.0±2.0\", \"-0.50±0.17pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired bar chart: 3 seeds × 2 conditions (marker/nomarker), with paired lines showing per-seed drop\"\n    analysis: \"3-seed nomarker mean=99.33%（与 marker 99.83% 差 0.50pp），std=0.17pp（marker 条件 std=0.00）。Marker removal 引入极小方差但不改变核心结论。McNemar 3-seed pooled: nomarker 仍显著优于 VOTA (99.33% vs 99.41%, 但 CI 重叠)。正面叙事：'exception content 是 sufficient signal，formatting 是 optional convenience'。\"\n\n  - name: \"loop_only_seed123\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: \"Qwen-7B loop_only component seed123 复现\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.8118\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.7882\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.8345\n      n: 1190\n      pass_precision: 0.896\n      pass_recall: 0.838\n      pass_f1: 0.866\n      fail_precision: 0.649\n      fail_recall: 0.748\n      fail_f1: 0.695\n      train_loss: 0.078\n      drop_vs_seed42: -0.0445\n    result_rationale: \"Loop compression 是 Tier 2 behavioral signal，需要模型理解循环执行模式（iteration counts, early termination）。与 Tier 1 exception signal（binary fault presence）不同，loop pattern 的学习对 LoRA 初始化更敏感。Seed123 落入较差的 basin，对 loop→verdict mapping 的 fail 类学习不充分（fail_recall 从 seed42 的 82% 降至 ~75%）。4.5pp drop 对应 ~53 个额外 errors，主要集中在 loop 正常但代码实际有 non-loop-related bugs 的 samples（loop 信号无法区分）。这证实 Tier 2 信号的 model-dependent + seed-dependent 特性。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Seed123 的 81.2% 仍显著高于 no_trace (75.13%, p<0.01)，但相对 seed42 (85.63%) drop 4.5pp 说明 loop signal 的 learnability 方差较大。对比 exception_only seed123 仍是 99.83%——Tier 1 vs Tier 2 的 seed robustness 差异鲜明。\"\n\n  - name: \"loop_only_seed456\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: \"Qwen-7B loop_only component seed456 复现\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.8807\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.8613\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.8992\n      n: 1190\n      pass_precision: 0.936\n      pass_recall: 0.892\n      pass_f1: 0.913\n      fail_precision: 0.766\n      fail_recall: 0.851\n      fail_f1: 0.806\n      train_loss: 0.069\n      lift_vs_seed42: 0.0244\n    result_rationale: \"Seed456 LoRA 初始化落入较好的 basin，loop→verdict mapping 学习更充分。Fail_recall 从 seed42 的 82% 提升至 85%，加上 pass 类也有改善（+2pp recall）。总体 88.1% 是 loop_only 条件的 upper range，但仍远低于 exception_only (99.83%)，确认 Tier 2 信号即使在最好 seed 下也无法匹配 Tier 1。差异主要来源：loop compression 仅编码 behavioral pattern（iteration count, convergence），无法捕获 non-iterative failures (assertion errors, type errors, edge case bugs)。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"loop_only_3seed_summary\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"accuracy\", \"fail_recall\", \"interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [42, \"85.63%\", 0.820, \"baseline\"]\n          - [123, \"81.18%\", 0.748, \"LoRA 较差 basin\"]\n          - [456, \"88.07%\", 0.851, \"LoRA 较好 basin\"]\n          - [\"mean±std\", \"84.96%±3.47\", \"0.806±0.053\", \"Tier 2 seed-sensitive\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Violin plot: loop_only 3-seed distribution vs exception_only 3-seed distribution (后者为单点 99.83%)\"\n      - \"Error analysis: Venn diagram of errors across 3 seeds — showing low overlap (seed-specific failures)\"\n    analysis: \"3-seed std=3.47pp（vs exception_only std=0.00pp）。这是 Claim 3 'Tier 2 seed-dependent stability' caveat 的核心证据。Range 81-88% 意味着 loop_only 的 usefulness 取决于 training luck，而 exception_only 完全不依赖。论文措辞从 'robust behavioral signal' 弱化为 'useful but variable behavioral signal, fully subsumed by Tier 1 exception events.' 同时 loop_only mean (84.96%) ≈ full_trace_label_only (86.22%)，确认 VOTA loop compression 精确提取 full trace 中的 useful behavioral subset。\"\n\n  - name: \"qwen15b_vota_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_1.5b_scaling\"\n    description: \"Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B VOTA SFT\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9697\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9596\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.9790\n      n: 1190\n      pass_precision: 0.978\n      pass_recall: 0.982\n      pass_f1: 0.980\n      fail_precision: 0.945\n      fail_recall: 0.937\n      fail_f1: 0.941\n      train_loss: 0.065\n      eval_loss: 0.12\n      lift_vs_no_trace: 0.2966\n      gap_vs_exception_only: -0.0286\n    result_rationale: \"1.5B 模型在 VOTA 条件下达 97.0%——远高于预期的 'small model struggles with trace reasoning' 叙事。原因：(1) VOTA trace 在此数据集上已经高度结构化（exception + ae + loop 三组件），1.5B 有足够容量记忆这些 pattern；(2) 训练 3 epochs 在仅 4720 samples 上允许充分拟合；(3) max_length=2048 对 1.5B VOTA 同样适用且 Qwen tokenizer 的 VOTA 样本大多在 2048 以内（Qwen 7B 无截断问题）。关键：exception_only 已达 99.83%（与 7B 完全一致），VOTA gap 仅 2.86pp（vs 7B 的 0.42pp）——gap 存在但缩窄的方向反了。实际上是 VOTA 在 1.5B 上降了（99.41→97.0%）而 exception 不降（99.83→99.83%），说明 VOTA 的 Tier 2 组件（loop compression）需要更多 model capacity，而 exception signal 的 simplicity 让 1.5B 也能完美学习。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"qwen15b_condition_comparison\"\n        columns: [\"condition\", \"1.5B accuracy\", \"7B accuracy\", \"cross-scale gap\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"no_trace\", \"67.31%\", \"75.13%\", \"-7.82pp\"]\n          - [\"VOTA\", \"97.0%\", \"99.41%\", \"-2.41pp\"]\n          - [\"exception_only\", \"99.83%\", \"99.83%\", \"0.00pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: 1.5B vs 7B across conditions, highlighting exception_only zero gap\"\n      - \"Line plot: model scale (x) vs accuracy (y) per condition — showing exception_only flat line, VOTA slight decrease, no_trace steeper decrease\"\n    analysis: \"1.5B VOTA 97.0% 削弱了 'exception dominates VOTA' 的 accuracy gap claim（差距仅 2.86pp，虽然 7B 上 exception 与 VOTA McNemar p=0.01，1.5B 上 p 可能更显著因为 gap 更大）。但反过来强化了 efficiency + robustness angle: exception_only 在 1.5B 上与 7B 完全一致（99.83%），不受模型规模影响；VOTA 在 1.5B 上降 2.4pp，说明其 Tier 2 组件的 model-capability dependency。Claim 1 pivot: 'exception is sufficient and simplest — achieving identical performance (99.83%) regardless of model scale, while VOTA performance degrades on smaller models.' 这在 EMNLP 是强 practical argument。\"\n\n  - name: \"qwen15b_full_trace_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_1.5b_scaling\"\n    description: \"Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B full_trace SFT\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.7445\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.7193\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.7689\n      n: 1190\n      pass_precision: 0.842\n      pass_recall: 0.793\n      pass_f1: 0.817\n      fail_precision: 0.548\n      fail_recall: 0.623\n      fail_f1: 0.583\n      train_loss: 0.062\n      eval_loss: 0.095\n      lift_vs_no_trace: 0.0714\n    result_rationale: \"1.5B full_trace 预计 74.5%（vs 7B 的 81.76%，drop 7.3pp）。较小模型在处理长 full trace（高噪声、信息过载）时能力更弱。但不会像 DeepSeek full_trace v1 那样完全坍塌，因为 Qwen tokenizer 对 full trace 的 token 化效率较好，label 不会被截断。74.5% 略高于 no_trace (67.31%)——full trace 仍提供 marginal benefit (+7.1pp)，但远低于 VOTA (97.0%) 和 exception_only (99.83%)。1.5B 上 information overload 问题更严重：模型容量小 → attention 被 noisy tokens 稀释更多 → gradient dilution + information overload 双重效应放大。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"information_density_scaling\"\n        columns: [\"condition\", \"1.5B\", \"7B\", \"gap\", \"interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"no_trace\", \"67.31%\", \"75.13%\", \"-7.82pp\", \"baseline capability gap\"]\n          - [\"full_trace\", \"74.45%\", \"81.76%\", \"-7.31pp\", \"information overload scales with model size\"]\n          - [\"VOTA\", \"97.0%\", \"99.41%\", \"-2.41pp\", \"compressed trace partially compensates\"]\n          - [\"exception_only\", \"99.83%\", \"99.83%\", \"0.00pp\", \"minimal signal immune to scale\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: condition × model_size → accuracy, with color gradient showing scale sensitivity\"\n    analysis: \"Full_trace 在 1.5B 上仅 marginal improvement over no_trace (+7.1pp vs 7B 的 +6.6pp)，information overload 在小模型上没有更严重（gap 保持 ~7pp），但 base capability 更低。关键对比：full_trace→exception_only lift 在 1.5B 上为 25.4pp（vs 7B 18.1pp），说明小模型从 signal extraction 中获益更多——进一步支持 'information density is the bottleneck, smaller models suffer more from it' 论点。这强化 Claim 2。\"\n\n  - name: \"codellama13b_exception_only_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_3rd_model\"\n    description: \"CodeLlama-13B-Instruct exception_only SFT\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9950\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9907\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.9983\n      n: 1190\n      pass_precision: 1.0\n      pass_recall: 0.993\n      pass_f1: 0.996\n      fail_precision: 0.985\n      fail_recall: 1.0\n      fail_f1: 0.992\n      train_loss: 0.098\n      errors: 6\n    result_rationale: \"CodeLlama-13B 是 13B 参数模型（比 Qwen 7B/DeepSeek 6.7B 大约 2x），exception signal 的 structural simplicity 使其在更大模型上同样容易学习。预计 99.50%——略低于 Qwen 7B (99.83%) 的 2 errors irreducible ceiling，因为 CodeLlama 的 chat template 和 tokenizer 与 Qwen 不同，可能引入 2-4 个额外 borderline errors。但仍然是 near-perfect，远高于 VOTA 条件。6 errors 中 2 个是 GeneratorExit irreducible，4 个是 tokenizer/template 差异导致的 edge cases。这作为第 3 个模型验证 exception signal 的 cross-architecture robustness。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"第 3 模型达 99.50% 将 effective_model_count 从 2 提升至 3（Qwen 99.83%, CodeLlama 99.50%, DeepSeek 99.33% median）。exception_only 在 3 个架构不同的模型上均 >99%（最差情况排除 DeepSeek seed123 outlier），构成 strong cross-model evidence。\"\n\n  - name: \"codellama13b_no_trace_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_3rd_model\"\n    description: \"CodeLlama-13B-Instruct no_trace baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.7622\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.7378\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.7857\n      n: 1190\n      pass_precision: 0.864\n      pass_recall: 0.790\n      pass_f1: 0.826\n      fail_precision: 0.578\n      fail_recall: 0.694\n      fail_f1: 0.631\n      train_loss: 0.165\n    result_rationale: \"CodeLlama-13B 的 no_trace baseline 预计 76.2%——介于 Qwen 7B (75.13%) 和 DeepSeek (73.36%) 之间偏高。13B 参数量提供略多的 pre-trained knowledge (code pattern recognition from source code alone)，但没有 trace 信息时 ceiling 仍被 'guessing from code structure' 限制。CodeLlama 虽然更大，但在 HumanEval/MBPP 这类 competitive programming 题目上其 base code understanding 不必然比 Qwen-7B-Coder (specialized for code) 强很多。Cross-model no_trace gap 维持在 ~2-3pp 范围内（73-76%），确认 baseline capability 跨模型一致。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"no_trace 76.2% 作为 CodeLlama 的 baseline，exception_only lift = 23.3pp（vs Qwen 24.7pp, DeepSeek 26.0pp）。跨模型 trace lift 一致性（23-26pp range）是 trace value 论证的重要支撑。\"\n\n  - name: \"codellama13b_vota_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_3rd_model\"\n    description: \"CodeLlama-13B-Instruct VOTA SFT\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9244\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9092\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.9387\n      n: 1190\n      pass_precision: 0.924\n      pass_recall: 0.980\n      pass_f1: 0.951\n      fail_precision: 0.925\n      fail_recall: 0.785\n      fail_f1: 0.849\n      train_loss: 0.058\n      eval_loss: 0.098\n      gap_vs_exception_only: -0.0706\n    result_rationale: \"CodeLlama-13B VOTA 预计 92.4%——介于 Qwen (99.41%) 和 DeepSeek (84.45%) 之间。CodeLlama 的 execution reasoning capability (CRUXEval-I ~45-48%, 介于 Qwen 56.5% 和 DeepSeek 39% 之间) 决定了其 VOTA utilization 能力。此外需检查 CodeLlama tokenizer 对 VOTA trace 的 token 化效率——如果存在部分截断（类似 DeepSeek），会进一步拉低。VOTA 在 CodeLlama 上 gap vs exception_only 为 7.1pp，远大于 Qwen (0.42pp) 但小于 DeepSeek (14.9pp worst-case)。这符合 'VOTA effectiveness is model-capability-dependent, exception signal bypasses this dependency' 叙事。Fail_recall 78.5% 反映对 loop compression 信息的利用不完全。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"3model_vota_vs_exception_comparison\"\n        columns: [\"model\", \"exception_only\", \"VOTA\", \"gap\", \"CRUXEval-I (est.)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B\", \"99.83%\", \"99.41%\", \"0.42pp\", \"56.5%\"]\n          - [\"CodeLlama-13B\", \"99.50%\", \"92.44%\", \"7.06pp\", \"~46%\"]\n          - [\"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B\", \"99.33%*\", \"84.45%\", \"14.88pp\", \"39.0%\"]\n      - name: \"cross_model_summary_all\"\n        columns: [\"condition\", \"Qwen-7B\", \"Qwen-1.5B\", \"CodeLlama-13B\", \"DeepSeek-6.7B\", \"cross-model std\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"exception_only\", \"99.83%\", \"99.83%\", \"99.50%\", \"99.33%†\", \"0.24pp\"]\n          - [\"VOTA\", \"99.41%\", \"97.0%\", \"92.44%\", \"84.45%\", \"6.56pp\"]\n          - [\"no_trace\", \"75.13%\", \"67.31%\", \"76.22%\", \"73.36%\", \"3.86pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: CRUXEval-I score (x) vs VOTA accuracy (y) with regression line — showing correlation, but exception_only as horizontal line at ~99.5%\"\n      - \"Radar chart: 4 models × 3 conditions, showing exception_only's uniform near-ceiling performance\"\n    analysis: \"CodeLlama VOTA 92.4% 提供了 CRUXEval-VOTA 相关性假说的第 3 个数据点（N=3 仍不足以 claim causation，但 trend 一致：execution reasoning 越强 → VOTA 利用越好）。关键：exception_only cross-model std = 0.24pp vs VOTA cross-model std = 6.56pp (27x ratio)。这是论文最强的定量 evidence for 'exception signal is the most robust component'。Exception 对 model capability 几乎完全 invariant（99.3-99.8%），而 VOTA 高度 model-dependent（84-99%）。Models_where_exception > VOTA = 3/3 (4/4 if count 1.5B)。\"\n\n# Aggregated median-tier narrative impact\naggregate_analysis:\n  claim1_revision: \"Exception events are sufficient and simplest: achieving 99.3-99.8% across 3-4 models regardless of scale (1.5B-13B) or architecture, while VOTA shows 15pp cross-model variance (84-99%). The [ERROR] marker is optional (nomarker drop <1pp); exception content semantics are the active ingredient.\"\n  claim2_reinforcement: \"1.5B data strengthens information density argument: smaller models benefit MORE from signal extraction (full_trace→exception lift = 25.4pp on 1.5B vs 18.1pp on 7B), confirming information overload as scale-dependent bottleneck.\"\n  claim3_caveat: \"Tier 2 (loop_only) 3-seed std=3.47pp confirms seed-dependent stability. Tier 1 (exception_only) 3-seed std=0.00pp. Description revised to 'useful but variable behavioral signal.'\"\n  venue_impact: \"EMNLP main still viable. Sufficiency + efficiency + cross-model robustness angle strengthened by 3rd model + 1.5B evidence. Reviewer concern about 'only dominance on one model' resolved. Primary weakness: exception > VOTA gap on 1.5B is only 2.86pp (borderline practical significance) — pivot to 'same accuracy, 16x fewer tokens, no execution reasoning requirement' as deployment argument.\"\n  key_risk: \"If qwen15b_vota actually reaches 99%+ (upper bound of median range), exception_only advantage disappears on this model pair. Mitigation: frame as 'exception achieves VOTA-level with dramatically less complexity' — a sufficiency claim not requiring strict dominance.\"\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"94c45f9c-07e7-4d3f-a4f8-3f90e0df099a","total_cost_usd":0.5065575,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":33168,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":10604,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":33168,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":10604,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":33168,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":33168},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":28122,"outputTokens":21,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.028227000000000002,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":10604,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":33168,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.4783305,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"61388b3b-5594-4e5c-8398-dd6c665104d6"}
